      "text": [
        "WHAT CLIENTS SAY",
        "Moved to Manchester and was looking for a new barber. Found through TikTok and never looked back. Best service around",
        "Great barber. Really welcoming and always cuts perfectly and it very reliable. Price is great as well, so would definitely recommend. Really nice studio in an easy access location.",
        "Been going to ea for around 3 years amazing barber and service 🤙",
        "Emmanuel is the best barber in Manchester at chair and blade, 100% recommend to anyone trying to find a new barber. Incredibly friendly and the atmosphere is so chill and relaxing",
        "Best barber in Manchester!",
        "Cold trims and cold tunes. What more can you want",
        "Response from Chair and BladeThank you so much Morgan for your kind review :)",
        "Response from Chair and Blade",
        "Response from Chair and BladeHello Caelen, thank you for your kind review. I’m glad you feel welcomed each time you arrive and the location is accessible enough for you to be a consistent client.",
        "Response from Chair and BladeThank you so much for your review and loyalty :)",
        "Response from Chair and BladeThank you Evie for your review ! Highly appreciated:))",
        "Response from Chair and BladeThat’s the one ! Thank you for your supportive review :)",
        "Response from Chair and BladeWhat more can you want indeed !! Thank you so much for your review :)"
      ]
