      "text": [
        "SERVICES",
        "Haircut",
        "Haircut£30A full haircut. We talk through what you want, then I cut, shape, and finish it properly. No rushing, no clippers on autopilot.",
        "Haircut + Beard Trim£35The haircut, with your beard lined out and shaped to match. Sharp from the top of the fade to the edge of the jaw.",
        "Full Shape Up (Hair & Beard)£20Hairline and beard edged up between cuts. Keeps you looking fresh without sitting for a full cut.",
        "Shape Up (Hair Only)£15Your hairline and edges cleaned up between cuts. Quick, and you walk out sharp again.",
        "Beard£15Beard trimmed, shaped, and lined out on its own.",
        "Children’s Haircut£25A proper cut for under-16s, done at their pace. Tell me the style when you book and I’ll set aside the time.",
        "Premium Grooming",
        "Haircut + Black Mask£35Your haircut, finished with a charcoal black mask. It draws the blackheads, oil, and city grime out of your pores and leaves the skin clean and tight.",
        "Haircut + Beard Trim + Black Mask£40Haircut and beard trim, then a charcoal black mask to pull the grime out of your pores and tighten the skin.",
        "Haircut + Facial£50Your haircut with a full facial. I cleanse, exfoliate, and moisturise to clear tired, dry skin and soften the beard area, so your face looks as sharp as the cut.",
        "Haircut + Beard Trim + Facial£55Haircut, beard trim, and a full facial to cleanse, exfoliate, and refresh the skin.",
        "Haircut + Skin Hydration Mask + Massage£50Your haircut with a hydration mask that puts moisture back into dry, tight skin, plus a scalp and shoulder massage to take the tension out.",
        "Haircut + Beard Trim + Hydration Mask + Massage£55Haircut and beard trim, a hydration mask for tired skin, and a scalp and shoulder massage to finish you off relaxed.",
        "Haircut + All Premium Services£70The full treatment. Your haircut, the charcoal mask, a facial, a hydration mask, and a scalp and shoulder massage. You leave sharp, clean, and reset.",
        "Haircut + Beard Trim + All Premium Services£75Everything, beard included. Haircut, beard trim, charcoal mask, facial, hydration mask, and a scalp and shoulder massage. The complete sit-down.",
        "Hair Wash",
        "Hair Wash£10A wash and scalp rinse on its own.",
        "Hair Wash + Haircut£45A wash and scalp rinse to start, then your full haircut.",
        "Hair Wash + Haircut + Beard Trim£50A wash to start, then the haircut and beard trim.",
        "Appointments only · On-site parking available 8am–8pm",
        "Masks, facials & massage therapy"
      ]
