        "Founder, Chair and Blade",
        "My name’s Emmanuel Adjei — to my clients, EA Blades. I’m a Manchester barber, London School of Barbering graduate, educator and mentor. I built my name from the ground up, one fade at a time, through consistency, quality and precision.",
        "That journey led me to become the official barber for the cast of Hamilton the Musical, and to open my own place: Chair and Blade. For me it’s always been about impact, presence, and doing everything with passion.",
        "My vision’s simple: use my craft to help people feel like the sharpest version of themselves. Whether it’s a fade, a conversation in the chair, or the energy I bring to the room, my goal is to leave you better than I found you. That’s why my clients know — it’s all in the fades.",
        "Official barber for the cast of Hamilton the Musical",
        "London School of Barbering graduate",
        "Specialist in skin fades, tapers, and textured cuts",
        "Barber educator and industry mentor"
      ]
    }
